(D1 - Discrepancy 1 repro: LANGUAGE.md:1290 says "A quoted field name prints in
 the quotes it is written with." All three fields below are written in quotes.
 Only the multi-word one comes back quoted; the two single-word names print
 bare. The rule the compiler follows is "quote a name that needs quoting",
 not "print the quotes it was written with".
 Ran: VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox D1.vox -o p && ./p
 expected output:
   {'day sent': 25, depth: 2, altitude: 1}
)
